{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adopt your very own 3D desk pet and bring a touch of healing color to your desktop!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with your Cub: Tap, poke, and pet to trigger adorable reactions\u2014yes, you can even lift them up high!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/f157e03f048cc36b2985207df25375a8.poster.avif?t=1772507497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/f157e03f048cc36b2985207df25375a8.webm?t=1772507497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/f157e03f048cc36b2985207df25375a8.mp4?t=1772507497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up your Cub: Mix and match outfits, hairstyles, and eye colors. Every day is a new fashion show!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/be016b1e94d160ab71d7e5544fccd8fe.poster.avif?t=1772507497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/be016b1e94d160ab71d7e5544fccd8fe.webm?t=1772507497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/be016b1e94d160ab71d7e5544fccd8fe.mp4?t=1772507497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Cub\u2019s garden: Unlock plants, flowers, and landscapes to create a refreshing little paradise right on your desk.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/71929365a6168805ec2c2f74947effcb.poster.avif?t=1772507497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/71929365a6168805ec2c2f74947effcb.webm?t=1772507497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/71929365a6168805ec2c2f74947effcb.mp4?t=1772507497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your Cub grow: Good Cubs water plants by themselves, and good plants grow quietly on their own\u2014true relaxation means hands-free care!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/a8cd2bd3f5d3b06a9ee9c410a3665086.poster.avif?t=1772507497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/a8cd2bd3f5d3b06a9ee9c410a3665086.webm?t=1772507497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/a8cd2bd3f5d3b06a9ee9c410a3665086.mp4?t=1772507497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More daily surprises await\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry Cub? Feed them tasty treats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lazy Cub? Find something fun to play with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s that\u2014a bug? Catch it quick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/94b00480642ddea1c9d3ef16aef85d7a.poster.avif?t=1772507497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/94b00480642ddea1c9d3ef16aef85d7a.webm?t=1772507497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/94b00480642ddea1c9d3ef16aef85d7a.mp4?t=1772507497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/80576ffca878ffc4ed0588ffd0cfbc23.poster.avif?t=1772507497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/80576ffca878ffc4ed0588ffd0cfbc23.webm?t=1772507497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/80576ffca878ffc4ed0588ffd0cfbc23.mp4?t=1772507497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cubs Story is here to bring you moments of joy and relaxation. Whether it\u2019s a quick interaction during a busy day or some careful tending in your free time, your Cub will always be the faithful companion who never logs off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/extras/61dcdd1d6ff5a6dcdb3f1e487a357b84.avif?t=1772507497\" width=620 height=259 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3285900?t=1772507497","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3285900?t=1772507497","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285900/a1f3aa7c994d71072502fc59a9a89265f0806f65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772507497","capsule_imag